{
  "info": {
    "name": "BCRG - Declaration reglementaire (CRG) v1.13",
    "description": "API de declaration BCRG exposee par le CRG (v1.13 - 09/09/2026).\nBase : https://digi-creditrural-io.com/bcrg — Auth : header X-API-Key (fourni par le CRG), ajoute automatiquement par la collection.\n\nCIRCUIT : 1) extraire PP/PM (statut=restantes) -> integrer au SIC -> notifier via POST /traitements ; 2) extraire les engagements (les beneficiaires doivent avoir ete notifies) -> integrer -> notifier ; 3) GET /encours (filtre=declares, defaut) restitue les credits dont l'engagement est notifie.\n\nREFERENCES (v1.13) : RefIntEng = code agence (3 chiffres) + numero de credit concatenes, ex. 102540631. Les anciens formats (102-540631, numero nu) restent acceptes dans /traitements.\nPERIODE (/encours) : AAAA-MM = date d'arrete des calculs (DatArr), ne filtre pas les donnees.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "apikey",
    "apikey": [
      {
        "key": "key",
        "value": "X-API-Key",
        "type": "string"
      },
      {
        "key": "value",
        "value": "{{apiKey}}",
        "type": "string"
      },
      {
        "key": "in",
        "value": "header",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "https://digi-creditrural-io.com/bcrg"
    },
    {
      "key": "apiKey",
      "value": "REMPLACER_PAR_LA_CLE_FOURNIE"
    },
    {
      "key": "idClient",
      "value": "10200001236"
    },
    {
      "key": "refEng",
      "value": "102540631"
    },
    {
      "key": "periode",
      "value": "2026-09"
    },
    {
      "key": "module",
      "value": "ENGAGEMENT"
    }
  ],
